fuata (104:2)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <a href=\"/en/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" data-l=\"en\">English</a> · <a href=\"/ur/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"ur\" lang=\"ur\" data-l=\"ur\">اردو</a> · <a href=\"/id/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"id\" lang=\"id\" data-l=\"id\">Bahasa Indonesia</a> · <a href=\"/tr/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\" data-l=\"tr\">Türkçe</a> · <a href=\"/fr/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\" data-l=\"fr\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/bn/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"bn\" lang=\"bn\" data-l=\"bn\">বাংলা</a> · <a href=\"/ms/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"ms\" lang=\"ms\" data-l=\"ms\">Bahasa Melayu</a> · <a href=\"/fa/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" data-l=\"fa\">فارسی</a> · <a href=\"/ru/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\" data-l=\"ru\">Русский</a> · <b lang=\"sw\">Kiswahili</b> · <a href=\"/ha/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"ha\" lang=\"ha\" data-l=\"ha\">Hausa</a> · <a href=\"/es/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\" data-l=\"es\">Español</a> · <a href=\"/de/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"de\" lang=\"de\" data-l=\"de\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/zh/ayah/104-1.html\" hreflang=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" data-l=\"zh\">中文</a></nav>\n<footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n<script>try{localStorage.setItem(\"lang\",\"sw\")}catch(e){}document.addEventListener(\"click\",function(e){var a=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest(\"[data-l]\");if(a)try{localStorage.setItem(\"lang\",a.dataset.l)}catch(x){}})</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/104-2.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name